{
  "_doc": "Enemy kinds. recipe = the citykit recipe drawn for it. job = how it fights (enemies.js JOBS). Numbers: hp, speed in tiles/s, radius in tiles, dmg per hit, range in tiles, cd = seconds between attacks. score feeds the grade; mats = materials dropped (Scrap/Alloy/Exotic chance). sparing = kinds the owner wants used rarely (missions cap them). boss = job boss (js/sim/boss.js): parts (hit zones by bearing `at` and half-width `arc` in degrees from her facing; hp; drop = boss material count; spawn = sacs; claw/slow = claws; lockedBy + weak = an armoured weak point), claw/charge/barrage/lob = attacks (every one winds up and marks the ground first), phases = health shares that each trigger once (a roar + a brood wave, then a new attack). Rival aces are in data/aces.json (kinds ace:<id>; its grunts — Halden-Voss line frames hv-light, hv-heavy — use their own id). Round 5 roles (sim/roles.js): flame = walks to range, a pilot-light flicker for light seconds, then a fire cone (half-angle arc radians, reach range) for spray seconds, dmg per second, burns; shieldgen = holds a dome (radius dome) behind the army units within gather tiles of it, never nearer a frame than keep; army units inside take shieldCut less damage; heal = flies to the most hurt army unit within seek tiles and heals heal hp/s within reach, keeps keep tiles from frames, runs flee seconds when shot; drift = drifts at a frame and bursts within range; prebake = animations baked during the drop besides walk and die (the job's pose); cloud = a spore cloud of that radius for cloudTime seconds (slows frames inside). dummy = a test-range target (job dummy: never attacks, never dies, refills after refill seconds without a hit; patrol = tiles it walks either side of its spot).",
